  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n**(1)/(2)+(1)/(3)-(1)/(6)div (3)/(5)times (3)/(5)**\n\n**Formula used:**\n\nDivision of fractions: (a)/(b) div (c)/(d) = (a)/(b) times (d)/(c)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n(1)/(6) div (3)/(5) = (1)/(6) times (5)/(3) = (5)/(18)\n\n(5)/(18) times (3)/(5) = (1)/(6)\n\n⇒ (1)/(2) + (1)/(3) - (1)/(6) \n\n⇒ (3)/(6) + (2)/(6) - (1)/(6) = (4)/(6) = (2)/(3)\n\n**∴ The correct answer is (2)/(3)**",
